id":"65ec5074-1572-42ea-83d3-82a9ae58b40a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"popup のフィルタかw","ts":"1637401750.098300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UcYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01abe70b-2f65-441e-8cec-113ca59ec219","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"popupそんなことできるのかw","ts":"1637401740.097700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vd8n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D07EADBA-5931-420F-91AA-41555EC53867","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ただNeovimではできなさそうな・・・","ts":"1637401726.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lql"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4296C4E7-A693-409B-A0BE-5AB230CD2FDC","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これかな","ts":"1637401699.096800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ntJnO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AA86C9CB-0CF1-4435-8358-BF36BA7F5FF0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://pocke.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/07/07/143120|https://pocke.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/07/07/143120\u003e","ts":"1637401696.096600","attachments":[{"fallback":"pockestrap: keycast.vimをつくった - pockestrap","id":1,"title":"keycast.vimをつくった - pockestrap","title_link":"https://pocke.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/07/07/143120","text":"Vimで入力した文字を表示するためのプラグイン、keycast.vimを作った。 \u003chttp://github.com|github.com\u003e screencast 仕組み 入力されたキーをbannerコマンドで大きくして、popup windowに表示している。 キーの入力 最初、Vimでキーの入力を監視する方法が見つからなくて苦労した。 最初のPoCではInsertCharPreを使っていた。 InsertCharPreはその名の通り、insertモード時に文字が入力される直前に呼ばれるイベントである。 つまり、normalモード時に入力された文字は受け取ることができない。 PoC キーストロークを表示するやつ pic.twit…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/P/Pocke/20190707/20190707141255.gif","blocks":null,"ts":1562477480,"service_name":"pockestrap","service_icon":"https://pocke.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://pocke.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/07/07/143120","original_url":"https://pocke.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/07/07/143120"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBT+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"115bf3d0-15fc-4fb2-8b9a-57ee72c26bff","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"もちろんInsert Modeは抜きで。","ts":"1637401426.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3my"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d25e92bf-dd61-482a-9766-fd4d5cd53350","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"あと、皆さんのようなvim熟練者のレコードを共有できるような物もあったらいいなぁと。","ts":"1637401411.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uKO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6c1e14c-593c-41b4-b005-4066219cde93","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"初学者が冗長にコマンドを打ってるときにこれ使うといいよみたいなサジェスチョン出すプラグイン作ろうと思うのです。\n`0$d` を `dd` とできるよとか、`0w` を `_` にできるよとか。","ts":"1637401353.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u/L1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2cc85b9-ef4a-494d-bd1c-6d877ed0fe9d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"何がしたいかにもよりますが、あとはマクロくらいしか思いつかない… (これは副作用がでかい)","ts":"1637401238.093000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4GHr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69ab578c-f18a-445a-bdcd-ecdb8f3f92df","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これだと起動時から終了時までですからね","ts":"1637401200.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Azj/W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d3dd463-d282-4735-80ef-b289b27bf355","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"でもプラグインで使いたいので、ちょっと微妙かなぁと。","ts":"1637401184.091700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oroll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27ea2b30-95b0-46c8-a1d1-b3d234a1dcd6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ぽいですね。今中身見た","ts":"1637401182.091600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NjJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76ac6c5f-540d-467a-b233-8292ddbde59b","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"なので、コンパイルし直せば、レコードはいけるってIssueに書いてありました。","ts":"1637401149.091000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WPJNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a87d38b-a7e3-4e76-a21b-cab153db290e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こんなのがあるのか","ts":"1637401129.090700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f146d35-2552-4be9-aeb7-a5375a75233f","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"それなんですけど、すぐには記録されないんです。","ts":"1637401125.090300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tdHr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae55d60d-d198-4a6a-a62c-09bff8385b8a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"知らなかった","ts":"1637401123.090100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mCRY1"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *-w*\n-w {scriptout}  Vimを終了するまで、ユーザーが入力した全部の文字が記録され、ファ\n                イル{scriptout}に書き出される。これは \"vim -s\" や \":source!\"\n                で読込まれるスクリプトファイルを作成するのに役立つ。既にファイ\n                ル \"scriptout\" が存在する場合には、そのファイルに追加保存する。\n                |complex-repeat|も参照。\n                {scriptout} は数字で始まってはならない。\n```","ts":"1637401103.089600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b35078a9-3077-425a-9f5e-8c6d8cce2a84","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h -w  これではなく、ですかね","ts":"1637401102.089500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"12zCe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db148516-830c-4aa9-ba61-2329a05ff22d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"入力を全部奪うツールはあるので行けなくはないですが、Vimの外でやることになりますね\n例えばこんなの\n\u003chttps://github.com/asciinema/asciinema\u003e","ts":"1637401095.089200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"asciinema/asciinema","id":1,"title":"asciinema/asciinema","text":"Terminal session recorder :video_camera:","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://asciinema.org\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"9716","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fi29"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c23400d-26dc-420e-9927-f8eb774d48ed","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"neovimもなさそうなんですよね。","ts":"1637400867.087800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uI9fo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9ccc235-b07d-4450-808e-3a7b67bd998f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そんな機構ないですねー、あったら欲しいくらい","ts":"1637400847.087600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sweat_smile","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rF4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33f3a98e-f212-4a3b-b615-9ed393635f5d","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"vim でキーを監視する方法ご存知の方いますでしょうか。。\nこちらのIssueによれば、ビルドし直すか、OSレベルでやるか、待つしかないとのことのようで。。\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/6349\u003e","ts":"1637400818.087200","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/6349|#6349 Is there a way to log all my key press using vimscript?\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/6349|#6349 Is there a way to log all my key press using vimscript?\u003e","text":"I search `vim log` `vim record` `vim track` `vim keyfreq` `vim key` …… Still couldn't find a plugin or some code like Emacs's \u003chttps://github.com/dacap/keyfreq|https://github.com/dacap/keyfreq\u003e .  \nDoes the keylog thing violated some rules in Vim?  \nOr I should find a way outside Vim to achive?","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim|vim/vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1593258715}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nzy"}]}]
